  "body": "In the current spec we starts from the `\"writable\"` state. We occasionally discussed this but let's give a conclusion here.\n\nSince [[queue]] and [[strategy]] start working independent from the sink, I think it makes sense to start from `\"writable\"`. But I think we still need to consult [[strategy]] to determine the initial state as we do in `SyncWritableStreamStateWithQueue()`.\n\nAnother option is starting from the `\"waiting\"` state and change it to something else based on [[strategy]] when `start()` completes.\n",
